Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.91,0:00:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Asas das Magius" é uma organização que busca a libertação das Garotas Mágicas
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.66,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,do sistema que Kyubey construiu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.74,0:00:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nosso movimento vai se \Nespalhar por todo o mundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.38,0:00:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tamaki Iroha,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.88,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,permita-nos libertá-la também!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.59,0:00:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sei o que pensar disso tudo.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.51,0:00:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Para ser sincera, eu só queria te perguntar sobre a Ui.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.53,0:00:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Afaste-se dela, Mifuyu!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.11,0:00:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}O que pretende fazer?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.55,0:00:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yacchan, eu te peço que não interfira.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.24,0:01:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos mostrando a elas a \Nverdade sobre as Garotas Mágicas.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.24,0:01:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é hora de contar isso a elas!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,É cedo demais? É desnecessário?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.43,0:01:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Elas estão aqui porque você as permitiu vir.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.65,0:01:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cale-se!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.51,0:01:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi a mesma coisa comigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.80,0:01:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cale-se!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.48,0:01:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Yachiyo-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.19,0:01:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora você entende.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.01,0:01:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Você jamais deveria ter vindo.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.07,0:01:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos embora.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yachiyo-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.35,0:01:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vim até aqui com a Tsuruno-chan e as outras.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.00,0:01:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aonde será que elas foram?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.48,0:01:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A Mifuyu as levou.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.48,0:01:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisamos encontrá-las.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.41,0:02:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Espero que ainda estejam \Ndentro do Museu das Memórias.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.71,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Acha que elas estão bem?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.85,0:02:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Só podemos esperar que sim.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.32,0:02:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,E também, Tamaki-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.07,0:02:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.67,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou desfazer o time.
